# The versioned TER root-partition measurement artifacts are hash-verified byte
# streams: docs/root_partition_decision.md records SHA-256 digests of these exact
# files, and results/partition/task11-final-20260825/data-hashes.jsonl records a
# digest for every raw campaign file. core.autocrlf must therefore never rewrite
# their line endings, or the recorded digests stop verifying after a checkout.
/results/** -text
# The manuscript uses exact-byte SHA-256 manifests for its frozen inputs too.
# Preserve both LF and CRLF originals on every platform and checkout.
/paper/data/** -text
